   "y": 866,
   "w": 930,
   "h": 53,
   "html": "<h3>We came up with six products we were interested in and decided to focus on the 3D Texture UV Printer, as it represents a new and emerging technology.</h3>",
   "plain": "We came up with six products we were interested in and decided to focus on the 3",
