   "t": "text",
   "x": 8,
   "y": 1316,
   "w": 930,
   "h": 230,
   "html": "<p>PURPOSE:</p>\n\n<p>Explores advanced printing technology as a bridge between imagination and reality, transforming digital creativity into physical form.</p>\n\n<p>ELEMENTS:</p>\n\n<p>UV Printer(eufyMake): This is our hero object</p>\n\n<p>Flowing Color Swirls: Symbolize abstract creativity taking shape, while emphasizing true-to-life color fidelity.</p>\n\n<p>Printed Texture: The physical result of the printing process, showing how digital designs become tangible surfaces.</p>\n\n<p>Materials: Different real-world surfaces that demonstrate the printer&rsquo;s versatility and practical use.</p>",
   "plain": "PURPOSE:\n\nExplores advanced printing technology as a bridge between imagination ",
   "head": false
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "x": 16,
   "y": 1577,
   "w": 930,
   "h": 80,
