   "html": "<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Shot 1: Showcase the product</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Shot 2: Colors swirl and flow into the printer</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Shot 3: Demonstrate the printing process across various materials</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Shot 4: Close-up progression from smaller to larger non-flat objects, highlighting surface texture</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>",
